          ],
          "text": "Primary: NSTEMI\n\nSecondary: Severe three-vessel coronary artery disease, not suitable for PCI — managed medically following MDT decision.\n\nBackground:\n- Heart failure with reduced ejection fraction (EF 35%)\n- Chronic kidney disease stage 3b\n- Type 2 diabetes mellitus\n- Hypertension\n- Previous myocardial infarction 2019",
          "unverified_fact_ids": []
        },
        {
          "section_id": "sections.2",
          "part": "part_a",
          "heading": "key_investigations",
          "fact_ids": [
