            "key_investigations.2",
            "key_investigations.3",
            "key_investigations.4",
            "key_investigations.5"
          ],
          "text": "- ECG: T-wave inversion V4-6\n- Troponin: 287 rising to 412\n- Creatinine: 168 (Day 2, 13/05), improving to 142 (Day 4, 15/05)\n- GRACE score: high risk\n- Inpatient coronary angiogram: severe three-vessel disease",
