            "treatment.3",
            "treatment.4",
            "treatment.5",
            "treatment.6"
          ],
          "text": "- Ticagrelor added (dual antiplatelet therapy) and fondaparinux commenced.\n- Bisoprolol uptitrated to 7.5mg once daily.\n- Isosorbide mononitrate 30mg once daily added.\n- MDT decision: medical management only; not for PCI.\n- Mobilising with physiotherapy.\n- Cardiac rehabilitation referral completed.\n- DNACPR discussed and agreed with patient and family; DNACPR form completed 14/05.",
